# <%= classify(name) %>

NestJS 11 + TypeORM (PostgreSQL) monorepo (<%= apps.join(', ') %>). Generated with [fuse-nest-schematics](https://www.npmjs.com/package/fuse-nest-schematics). The frontend is [fuse-schematics](https://www.npmjs.com/package/fuse-schematics) (Fuse Admin, Angular).

## Ishga tushirish

```bash
cp .env.example .env      # DB_* va ADMIN_* qiymatlarini to'ldiring
npm install
npm run start:dev         # = start:dev:api
```

- API: `http://localhost:3000/api`
- Swagger: `http://localhost:3000/docs` (`SWAGGER_ENABLED=false` bilan o'chadi)
- Kirish: `POST /api/auth/sign-in` `{ email, password }` → `{ accessToken, user }`

## Ilovalar va skriptlar

| Ilova | Vazifa | Dev | Build | Prod |
|---|---|---|---|---|
<% for (const app of apps) { %>| `apps/<%= app %>` | <%= app === 'api' ? 'HTTP admin API' : app === 'bot' ? 'Telegram bot (telegraf, `BOT_TOKEN`)' : 'Cron/fon vazifalar (`@nestjs/schedule`)' %> | `npm run start:dev:<%= app %>` | `npm run build:<%= app %>` | `npm run start:prod:<%= app %>` |
<% } %>
`npm run build` builds every app into `dist/apps/<app>/main.js` (webpack).
More apps: `npm run g -- worker` (cron, `@nestjs/schedule`) and `npm run g -- bot` (Telegram, telegraf).

