│   ├── api.module.ts           # Config + Database + Auth + CRUD modullar
│   ├── auth/                   # JWT sign-in, AdminGuard, @AdminResource
│   └── modules/                # generatsiya qilingan CRUD modullar<% if (apps.includes('bot')) { %>
├── bot/src/                    # telegraf bot (DatabaseModule bilan)<% } %><% if (apps.includes('worker')) { %>
├── worker/src/                 # @Cron vazifalar<% } %>
libs/
├── database/src/               # @app/database
│   ├── base.entity.ts          # uuid id, createdAt, updatedAt, deletedAt (soft delete)
│   ├── entities/               # barcha entity'lar + index.ts barrel
│   ├── database.module.ts      # TypeORM (autoLoadEntities, SnakeNamingStrategy)
│   └── data-source.ts          # migratsiya CLI uchun
└── common/src/                 # @app/common
    ├── base/                   # BaseCrudService, BaseCrudController
    ├── dto/table-query.dto.ts  # PrimeNG TableQueryDTO + { count, data }
    ├── query/table-query.ts    # xavfsiz filter/sort/qidiruv
    ├── decorators/             # @AdminAccess, @Public, @RequirePermissions
    └── filters/                # yagona xato formati (PG xatolari → 400/409)
```

## CRUD modul qo'shish

`--fields` bilan (Nest CLI noma'lum flaglarni qabul qilmaydi, shuning uchun schematics-cli orqali):

```bash
npx -p @angular-devkit/schematics-cli schematics fuse-nest-schematics:crud product \
  --fields "name:string,price:number,active:boolean,note:text?,status:enum(draft|published)"
```

Faqat `name:string` maydoni bilan Nest CLI orqali ham bo'ladi (monorepoda `-p api` shart):

```bash
nest g -c fuse-nest-schematics crud product -p api
```

Natija:

- `libs/database/src/entities/product.entity.ts` (+ `entities/index.ts` ga export)
- `apps/api/src/modules/product/`: DTO (create/update/query), service, controller, module
- `ProductModule` `apps/api/src/api.module.ts` ga avtomatik ulanadi

Endpointlar `admin/product` ostida va Angular `BaseCrudService` bilan bir xil:

| Metod | Yo'l | Vazifa |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/admin/product` | hammasi (sahifasiz) |
| POST | `/api/admin/product/pagination` | PrimeNG jadval → `{ count, data }` |
| POST | `/api/admin/product/pagination/archive` | arxiv (soft-delete) |
| GET | `/api/admin/product/:id` | bitta yozuv |
| GET | `/api/admin/product/archive/:id` | arxivdagi yozuv |
| POST | `/api/admin/product` | yaratish |
| PUT | `/api/admin/product/:id` | tahrirlash |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/product/:id` | arxivga o'tkazish |
| GET | `/api/admin/product/repair/:id` | arxivdan tiklash |

## Migratsiyalar

`DB_SYNCHRONIZE=true` faqat lokalda. Productionda `DB_SYNCHRONIZE=false` qiling va migratsiyadan foydalaning (build shart emas, ts-node bilan ishlaydi):

```bash
npm run migration:generate --name=Init
npm run migration:run
```
